  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fiddling Around**: back after 94 archived shows (805 days); rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Doin My Time**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Talking Water**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Come Down the Mountain Katy Daly**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Ready for the Times to Get Better [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-23.MK22** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 132 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The soundman was still adjusting the mix during the first few songs, so the opening sounds a bit unsettled; Reviewer calls it an excellent pull, with the recording itself coming out well [3]\n- **billystrings2022-04-23**: source not stated; 2 songs; 135 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-23.MK22**: taped by Chris Hale; transferred by Hellion; source: Schoeps MK22 > Tascam DR680 [1]\n- **billystrings2022-04-23**: taped by Anne Dierlam; transferred by Anne Dierlam; source: Telefunken M60 hypers > Tascam X8 [2]",
